"P2819414728" "The digital display on the Visualization Console details the new Invention Enhancement samples."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2696046088" "Invention Enhancements are similar to traditional Enhancements, but they have additional bonuses.  They can be slotted at three levels higher than yours, but they cannot be combined with other Enhancements.  <br><br>However, they do not expire as you level.  The effectiveness of an Invention Enhancement is constant and based on the level of the Recipe. <br><br>There are also <color yellow>Enhancement Sets</color>. Putting the same enhancement set into one power will grant you <color yellow>set bonuses</color>. You can use these bonuses to increase your abilities. Finding that your endurance runs out too fast or that your attacks aren't as accurate? Find the set that gives these bonuses and put it into a power!<br><br>The best part of set bonuses are that they are applied to <color yellow>all your powers</color>.<br><br><color orange>Now, for your exercise, I would like you to go to that Visualization Console and read through my thorough database of Invention Enhancement samples.  Please report back to me when you have done so and provide me any insights you may have gleaned from this exercise.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P1838325602" "Read up on Invention Enhancements at the Visualization Console"
// SendOffString :
"P1980155566" "You will be amazed at the sheer vastness of the database of samples.  Emperor Cole himself has sampled my database!  I could not be prouder."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P881911626" "View Enhancement Information"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P222035672" "The Visualization Console will not come to you, {HeroName}.  You need to go over there and read up on all of the Invention Enhancement samples.  The database is quite extensive so you will want to start now."
// RequiresFailedText :
"P4273732135" "You have done very well, {HeroName}.  Unfortunately, our time of learning together has come to an end.  Never forget your education.  It is a wellspring that nourishes forever."

